            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've had cumin lassi's, and I was looking forward to making my first at home. You need to love, love, L-O-V-E cumin to enjoy this. It has so much cumin that it's the only thing that I could taste. IMO it needs the cumin reduced significantly (maybe start with just 1 tsp or less) and perhaps add some mint or fresh cilantro as a complement to the cumin. Sunaina, sorry for the bad review, but this recipe just didn't work for me.",
